c/vermont/addison-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those years. In 2025 the middle had July to August at 54% of normal and August to September at 52%. Grid 28727 had its driest year in 1963 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
